# OVL-11: and has none without it (the daemon runs alone in a pid namespace, so a Steam on the
# machine running the test cannot show).
steam not-running
tap guide 60
advance 400
expect overlay showing guide
expect overlay guide.labels "Quick Settings"
expect overlay guide.labels not:"Steam overlay"
---
shifts mode Guide layers -                              @0
sound guide Open rise                                   @60
overlay menu "Guide" selected "Quick Settings"          @60
overlay menu "Guide" selected "Quick Settings" + info 1 @100
